# Presented wide Stage keeps board space when the Set becomes tall.
settle 3
act stage-context-example
settle 3
capture 01_expanded_set
click .set-graph-reading Arrangement: Set
settle 3
click .set-graph-reading Arrangement: Circle of fifths
settle 3
assert snap graph-reading == Tonnetz
assert snap set-cards == 1
capture 02_tall_tonnetz
act collapse-tray
settle 3
capture 03_collapsed_set
log Stage sizing capture complete
